w Float32Array([...]),\n  k: 10\n});\n```\n\n## Requirements\n\n- Node.js >= 18\n- macOS (Intel processors)\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n","readmeFilename":"README.md","keywords":["ruvector","vector-database","vector-search","similarity-search","semantic-search","hnsw","native","napi","rust","macos","darwin","x64","intel","ai","machine-learning","embedding-database","simd","performance","ruv"],"author":{"name":"ruv.io Team","email":"info@ruv.io","url":"https://ruv.io"}}